==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|изо-|-йти́}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|изойти́}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=изойдти́|gem=y}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|изойти́|pf|impf=исходи́ть}}

# to be drained of, to shed a lot of (blood, tears, etc.)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''изойти́''' [[кровь|кро́вью]]|to become weak through loss of blood}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''изойти́''' [[слеза|слеза́ми]]|to cry one's heart out}}
# {{lb|ru|dated}} to [[expire]], to come to an end
#: {{ux|ru|[[весь|Всё]] [[чаять|ча́янное]] [[помире́ние]] [[с]] [[они|ни́ми]] '''изошло́'''.|All the hoped-for reconciliation with them came to an end.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg|изойти́|ppp=+|pap2=исше́дший*|padp2=исше́дши*|notes=* Only in the meaning "to come to an end".}}
